  * Fix GUI crash on launch (ModuleNotFoundError): ship the modules the desktop
    app needs but the meson install lists omitted — services/theme_service +
    tiling_service + np-host, views/appearance + profiles + setup, and the
    package __main__ + player_app. The toggle path was unaffected.

